silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_01_sections_04_concrete_anchor_4#stagethreedietarycard silm:hasLongDescription "The StageThreeDietaryCard is stage 3 after the 2026-04-26 dietary card event. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'D_Mittens^3', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
